- `src/**/*.cpp` *(novo)* — scanners, cleaner, UI
- `CMakeLists.txt`, `tests/` *(novo)*
- `.claude/agents/*.md`, `.claude/skills/*` *(novo)* — copiados de Bugmenn/claude
